{
  "info": {
    "name": "CampusOverflow API",
    "description": "CampusOverflow 校园问答平台后端接口集合（S2 后端骨架验收：POST /api/v1/questions 成功用例）。\n认证方式：服务端会话（Spring Session + Redis）+ HttpOnly Cookie；CSRF 采用双提交 Cookie（XSRF-TOKEN Cookie → X-XSRF-TOKEN 请求头），详见 ADR-003 与 SecurityConfig。\n使用说明：1) 在环境变量中设置 baseUrl（默认 http://localhost:8080）；2) 依次运行 注册（可选）→ 登录 → 获取 CSRF Token → 发布问题；3) Postman 会自动维护 SESSION / XSRF-TOKEN Cookie。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "username",
      "value": "2026111",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": "Campus2026",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "csrfToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "学生注册（可选前置）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"displayName\": \"测试同学\",\n  \"email\": \"test@campus.edu.cn\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"college\": \"计算机工程学院\",\n  \"className\": \"计科2412\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "学生注册。字段约束：username 4-20 字符、password 8-64 字符、displayName 2-20 字符、email ≤100 字符。成功返回 201 {\"id\": <userId>}。已有账号时请跳过本请求。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "登录（建立会话）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "学号/工号 + 密码登录。成功返回 200 与当前用户信息（MeView），并通过 Set-Cookie 下发 SESSION（HttpOnly）会话 Cookie，Postman Cookie Jar 会自动保存。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "获取 CSRF Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/csrf",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "csrf"
              ]
            },
            "description": "获取 CSRF Token（同时下发 XSRF-TOKEN Cookie）。响应为 {\"headerName\": \"X-XSRF-TOKEN\", \"token\": \"<token>\"}。Tests 脚本会把 token 存入集合变量 csrfToken，供发布问题请求的 X-XSRF-TOKEN 请求头使用。"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Question",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "发布问题（成功用例：POST /api/v1/questions）",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status is 201 Created\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"body contains question id\", function () {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('id');",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('questionId', json.id);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-XSRF-TOKEN",
                "value": "{{csrfToken}}",
                "description": "CSRF 双提交 Cookie 请求头，值来自「获取 CSRF Token」请求"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"跳表和红黑树在工程上如何取舍？\",\n  \"body\": \"课程项目里需要一个有序结构，二者的实现复杂度和并发友好程度差别很大，应该怎么选？\",\n  \"tags\": [\"数据结构\", \"跳表\"]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/questions",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "questions"
              ]
            },
            "description": "发布问题成功用例（对应实验详案 Lab 4 提交物 4）。\n请求体字段（与 QuestionController.QuestionRequest 一致）：\n- courseId：可选，课程 ID（Long，可为 null）；\n- title：必填，≤150 字符；\n- body：必填，≤30000 字符；\n- tags：必填，1-5 个标签。\n成功返回 201 {\"id\": <questionId>}。需要先执行「登录」与「获取 CSRF Token」两个前置请求（未登录返回 401，缺少 CSRF 返回 403）。"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
